-- Test case for an NNC keyword in a grid with an LGR.
-- A 4x1x1 grid whose first cell is refined into 2x1x1.  The two refined cells
-- come first in the leaf grid, so the leaf index of cells (2,1,1) to (4,1,1)
-- differs from their level-0 index.  The NNC keyword connects cells (2,1,1)
-- and (4,1,1), which share no face.
-- Fluid and rock data from SPE1.

RUNSPEC

TITLE
LGR_NNC

DIMENS
  4 1 1 /

EQLDIMS
/

TABDIMS
/

OIL
GAS
WATER
DISGAS

FIELD

START
  1 'JAN' 2015 /

WELLDIMS
  1 1 1 1 /

GRID

CARFIN
'LGR1'  1  1  1  1  1  1  2  1  1 /
ENDFIN

DX
  4*1000 /
DY
  4*1000 /
DZ
  4*50 /
TOPS
  4*8325 /
PORO
  4*0.3 /
PERMX
  4*500 /
PERMY
  4*500 /
PERMZ
  4*50 /

NNC
  2 1 1   4 1 1   10.0 /
/

PROPS

PVTW
  4017.55 1.038 3.22E-6 0.318 0.0 /
ROCK
  14.7 3E-6 /
